<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>When Christmas Comes Again - live from a restaurant in downtown Los Angeles</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">grentperez</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Christmas (live from a restaurant in downtown Los Angeles)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1fAFxdOAadcUcIkZpI01Lc</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.975" end="00:18.202">Who knows what next year holds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.202" end="00:21.919">I only hope that it brings me closer to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.919" end="00:25.334">Under the mistletoe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.334" end="00:28.622">Arms together we're wrapped in the weather</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.622" end="00:31.614">Christmas cheer and joyful tears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.614" end="00:35.143">Another reason to be falling in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.143" end="00:37.042">It's such a wondrous night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.042" end="00:38.895">Not a hiccup in sight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.895" end="00:42.044">There's nothing else l'd want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.044" end="00:48.529">Oh when Christmas comes again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.529" end="00:52.657">We'll be sat under a starry sky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.657" end="00:56.964">Wishin' it never ended</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.964" end="01:02.814">Every second spent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.814" end="01:06.133">We've cherished it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.133" end="01:09.854">Before all the lights that turned into</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.854" end="01:17.854">Christmas comes again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.865" end="01:22.278">Like carols and Christmas trees</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.278" end="01:26.066">A voice up in heaven so rich in the way that you glow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.066" end="01:29.436">A person that's meant for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.436" end="01:33.143">You're the reason l never needed the snow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.143" end="01:38.821">The soul that we bring into the season</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.821" end="01:40.711">On such a wondrous night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.711" end="01:42.724">Not a hiccup in sight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.724" end="01:46.529">There's nothing else l'd want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.529" end="01:52.590">When Christmas comes again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.590" end="01:56.435">We'll be sat under a starry sky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.435" end="02:01.117">Wishin' it never ended</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.117" end="02:06.718">Every second spent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.718" end="02:10.368">We've cherished it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.368" end="02:13.629">Before all the lights that turned into</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.629" end="02:21.629">Christmas comes again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.606" end="02:35.195">Christmas comes again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.195" end="02:39.427">We'll be sat under a starry sky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.427" end="02:42.487">Wishin' it never ends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.487" end="02:49.252">Oh, with every second spent</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.252" end="02:53.022">We've cherished it all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.022" end="02:56.334">Before all the lights that turned into.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.334" end="03:01.060">Christmas comes again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.060" end="03:03.117">oh...</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.117" end="03:10.050">When Christmas comes again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.050" end="03:14.050">When Christmas comes again</p></div></body></tt>